Beginner-level analog-to-digital conversion project

🔹 Requirements

STM32 development board (e.g., STM32F103 “Blue Pill”)

LED with current-limiting resistor

Potentiometer or analog sensor

STM32CubeIDE

🔹 How to Run

Connect the potentiometer to the ADC pin and LED to a GPIO pin.

Open the project in STM32CubeIDE.

Build and flash the code.

Adjust the potentiometer:

ADC < 2048 → LED OFF

ADC ≥ 2048 → LED ON ✅
